WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:47.490
[LUFFY]
"Take to the Sky!
Ride the Knockup Stream!"

3
00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:54.760
<b>The Knock-Up Stream</b>

4
00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:57.710
Where the heck is that
rubbery, bug‐eyed idiot?

5
00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.420
This is just like him!

6
00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:01.920
Didn't we all agree to be
here over 45 minutes ago?

7
00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.480
We're gonna miss the current!

8
00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:06.930
Ugh. I'm sure the genius
didn't even stop to consider

9
00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.730
how the gold would
weigh him down.

10
00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.930
Why does he always insist

11
00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:11.860
on making everything
ten times harder?

12
00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.190
[USOPP]
The only schedule
Luffy's concerned with

13
00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:15.240
is his own.

14
00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:17.110
Yeah. He's got a point there.

15
00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:19.850
You don't think someone in
town beat him up, do you?

16
00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:21.500
What, you mean that guy Bellamy?

17
00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.060
Well, if Bellamy
didn't beat him up,

18
00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:25.030
you better believe I will!

19
00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:27.490
Oh, is that right, tough girl?

20
00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:33.620
[LUFFY]
Hey!

21
00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:34.620
Huh?

22
00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.920
Look there! He's back.
I knew he'd make it.

23
00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.710
I did it, you guys!

24
00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:45.730
[SANJI]
Luffy, hurry!
We're already behind schedule!

25
00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:47.770
[laughing]

26
00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:49.560
[LUFFY]
Look, it's a Hercules!

27
00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.520
It took me forever to find it!

28
00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:52.900
You're kidding me!

29
00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:55.110
Are you crazy?!

30
00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:56.610
[gasps]

31
00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:05.040
[LUFFY]
Whoa! That's awesome!

32
00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:08.200
Introducing the Going
Merry flying edition.

33
00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:09.710
It can fly?!

34
00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.080
I know! They built
it just for us!

35
00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:14.620
[MASIRA CREW]
– Yahoo!
– Yahoo!

36
00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:15.370
[LUFFY laughs]

37
00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.080
[MASIRA CREW laughs]

38
00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.010
Morons.

39
00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:21.250
Something about it makes
me feel kinda uneasy.

40
00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.320
Well, for once I agree with you.

41
00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.240
Chickens don't even
know how to fly.

42
00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.940
They should've made it a pigeon.

43
00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:30.060
What's that got to do
with anything, ya dope?!

44
00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.600
It's time to set sail!

45
00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.560
C'mon, if you're with me,
let me hear it!

46
00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:34.740
[MASIRA CREW]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

47
00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:43.100
What are you waitin' for?
Get on board.

48
00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.770
Unless you plan on missin'
your chance at the sky.

49
00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:47.040
Like a fool.

50
00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.810
Heh. Thanks for the ship.

51
00:03:53.030 --> 00:03:55.860
Thank them. They built it.

52
00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.720
Yeah. Thanks for
the ship, you guys!

53
00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:01.220
You can have my Hercules!

54
00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:05.900
[SHOJO]
Ooh! Really?
You mean it? Are you sure?

55
00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:08.100
[ALL]
– That's so kind of you!
– That's so kind of you!

56
00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:10.280
All right, enough of
this foolishness!

57
00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:11.360
We don't have much time!

58
00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:14.820
[SHOJO]
Follow us! We'll lead the way!

59
00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:16.180
[USOPP]
Come on, Luffy! Let's go!

60
00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.810
[LUFFY]
Coming!

61
00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:24.980
[BELLAMY]
This "City of Gold"
is just a fairytale!

62
00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:28.120
That liar, Noland,
dreamt it all up!

63
00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.500
Saruyama!

64
00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.870
[MASIRA CREW]
– Aye!
– Aye!

65
00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.460
[CRICKET]
I'm counting on you, men.

66
00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.960
I don't care what happens,

67
00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.720
you give our friends here
everything you've got!

68
00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.890
[MASIRA CREW]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

69
00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:48.780
[LUFFY]
Time to set sail!

70
00:04:51.910 --> 00:04:53.460
You heard him. Shove off!

71
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:54.440
All right!

72
00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:56.940
Yes, Nami!

73
00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:11.920
[CRICKET]
Well, kid, looks like
this is where we part ways.

74
00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:13.960
Yep.

75
00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.840
[CRICKET]
There's only one thing
you gotta remember,

76
00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:18.430
above everything else.

77
00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:19.430
[LUFFY]
What?

78
00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:23.930
Not one person in history
has ever disproved

79
00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.890
the existence of sky island.

80
00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:30.570
People may say I'm crazy
and even laugh at me,

81
00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:32.570
but I don't care.

82
00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:36.610
I'm a romantic. Like you.

83
00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.240
Romantic.

84
00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.250
So long!

85
00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.830
Oh, yeah. Thanks for the gold.

86
00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:53.990
And hey, don't be fallin'
from the sky, ya hear?

87
00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.070
[chuckles]

88
00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:58.000
[LUFFY]
See ya around, Pops!

89
00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:00.800
[NAMI]
Thanks for everything, Cricket!

90
00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:01.920
[USOPP]
Think of us when you find

91
00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.220
the City of Gold, old‐timer!

92
00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:08.220
[LUFFY]
Try and take it easy, okay?!

93
00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.380
[CRICKET]
Mind your own business!

94
00:06:18.300 --> 00:06:20.800
[BLACKBEARD]
It's morning already?

95
00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:23.200
Burgess. See anything out there?

96
00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:26.570
[BURGESS]
Can't even see an
outline of the shore yet.

97
00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:30.170
You really think they're
going to that sky island?

98
00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:32.000
Yeah, so they say.

99
00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:34.090
They'll be pretty tough
to follow up there,

100
00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:37.010
so we gotta take care
of 'em before that.

101
00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:41.210
[MASIRA]
Okay, listen up!
It's currently 7:00 am.

102
00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:45.050
We need to arrive at our final
destination no later than 11:00.

103
00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.960
It's like Cricket
already told us.

104
00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.300
The spot where the
Knockup Stream erupts

105
00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:51.610
is different every single time.

106
00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:54.070
We need to get there
as early as possible

107
00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:57.230
in order to pin point
it's exact location.

108
00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.770
[LUFFY]
Check it out.

109
00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.570
[MASIRA]
It looks like
we're already running

110
00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:02.530
a little behind schedule.

111
00:07:02.570 --> 00:07:05.690
Hey! Are you knuckleheads
payin' attention?!

112
00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:08.980
[LUFFY]
Did you see that?
It has to face forward!

113
00:07:09.020 --> 00:07:11.940
Strange. I've never seen
a bird quite like him.

114
00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:12.860
[LUFFY laughing]

115
00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.990
He only faces south,
isn't that funny?

116
00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.120
The goofy bird acts
just like a compass!

117
00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:21.330
[LUFFY laughing]

118
00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:22.510
Did you hear what it said?

119
00:07:22.550 --> 00:07:25.300
He said he's going to face a
different direction on purpose

120
00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:27.040
and laugh at us once we're lost.

121
00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.130
[LUFFY laughs]

122
00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.520
[LUFFY]
Go ahead and try!

123
00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:32.890
[grunting]

124
00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:34.980
Whoa. He's really facing north.

125
00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:41.860
[grunting]

126
00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.530
[LUFFY]
Told ya he couldn't do it!

127
00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:46.530
[LUFFY, CHOPPER laughing]

128
00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:47.800
[SHOJO CREWMAN A]
Hey!

129
00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:50.530
Show the boss some respect
and pipe down over there!

130
00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.160
No. They're fine.

131
00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.250
Why, it reminds me
of the old days

132
00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.330
when I was young and irreverent.

133
00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:59.730
Uh‐oh. What'd they'd say?

134
00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:03.340
Hey! There's no point
gettin' so worked up, fella.

135
00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:05.670
Ha‐ha! Try to relax!

136
00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.930
And who put us
behind schedule again?

137
00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:10.140
You know what, he's right.

138
00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.640
Being tense won't
get us anywhere.

139
00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:13.850
We may as well enjoy ourselves.

140
00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:16.560
I see your point.
Full speed ahead, men.

141
00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:19.730
Anyone not relaxing
answers to me.

142
00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.320
[SHOJO CREW sighs]

143
00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:23.900
[LUFFY]
Ahh. That's better.

144
00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.660
[MASIRA CREW sighs]

145
00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:29.060
[ZORO]
This is ridiculous.

146
00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.600
[MASIRA CREWMAN A]
Boss! Look!

147
00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:31.680
What's wrong?

148
00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:35.400
I see the cumuloregalis cloud!
To the southwest!

149
00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:36.980
[MASIRA]
It can't be! What time is it?

150
00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:38.390
[MASIRA CREWMAN A]
Ten o'clock!

151
00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:40.520
They're a full hour early!

152
00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:43.340
[MASIRA]
Shojo! Do you
think we can make it?

153
00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:45.350
[SHOJO]
Dispatch the Utan Divers!

154
00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:47.170
Find me those currents!

155
00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:52.650
[NAMI]
They're incredible!

156
00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.390
What's going on now?

157
00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:56.950
The cumuloregalis
clouds appeared

158
00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:58.400
a lot sooner than expected,

159
00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.580
so now everyone's scrambling
to find a current!

160
00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:04.860
[screams]

161
00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:10.110
Sonar waves detected!

162
00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.030
There's a large current
at 12 o'clock!

163
00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:14.220
[SHOJO CREWMAN B]
Large creature
detected at nine o'clock!

164
00:09:14.260 --> 00:09:16.660
It could be a Sea King!

165
00:09:17.050 --> 00:09:19.600
There's wave activity
detected at ten o'clock

166
00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:20.850
going against the current!

167
00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.670
I believe it's a giant
whirlpool, sir!

168
00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:26.460
That's it! Full speed ahead
directly for ten o'clock!

169
00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.150
That's where the Knockup
Stream's gonna erupt,

170
00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.070
I'm sure of it!

171
00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.680
Now go!

172
00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:35.930
Hold on!

173
00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:37.930
[NAMI]
The waves are getting higher!

174
00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:40.030
[USOPP]
We're gonna sink!

175
00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:44.780
[MASIRA]
Steady, men.
It's a pre‐eruption tremor!

176
00:09:44.820 --> 00:09:46.070
[CHOPPER]
Eruption?!

177
00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:49.830
Hey, Navigator! What
does the Log Pose say?

178
00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:54.990
It's pointing straight
at those clouds!

179
00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:57.850
[USOPP]
You mean the sky
island's above that?

180
00:09:57.850 --> 00:09:59.520
The wind direction's perfect.

181
00:09:59.550 --> 00:10:01.050
The clouds are lining
up exactly over

182
00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:03.050
the center of the whirlpool.

183
00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:06.570
[LUFFY]
What whirlpool?
I haven't seen anything.

184
00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:07.840
Nice work, brother!

185
00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:09.970
I think we hit the
jackpot this time.

186
00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:13.430
Yes! And it seems we're in
for a nice‐sized explosion!

187
00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:14.930
[LUFFY]
Do you think we'll make it?

188
00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:15.970
[MASIRA]
Of course!

189
00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:18.850
What's that?

190
00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:21.140
We'll lead you
to the inner edge.

191
00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:23.560
All right. But what
should we do?

192
00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:26.780
Position yourself on the flow
and head towards the center.

193
00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:29.440
Then you'll be fine.

194
00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:32.070
[NAMI]
He wants us to go to the center?

195
00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:38.860
I don't remember
signing up for all this!

196
00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:39.730
[SANJI]
Don't worry!

197
00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.870
I'll make sure nothing
happens to you!

198
00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:44.540
[ROBIN]
I've never seen one
quite this big before.

199
00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.380
[chuckles]

200
00:10:47.380 --> 00:10:50.220
This is bad! I change my
mind! I wanna go back!

201
00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:52.300
[ZORO]
Sorry, Usopp, too late for that.

202
00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:54.430
"You know who"
is already excited.

203
00:10:54.470 --> 00:10:56.680
Let's go! To the sky!

204
00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:21.420
[MASIRA]
It's time for us to go!

205
00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:24.960
The rest is up to
you now! Good luck!

206
00:11:25.050 --> 00:11:27.180
Bye, guys! And thanks
a lot for everything!

207
00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:28.470
Don't go!

208
00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:30.640
Don't go! I don't want to die!

209
00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:34.480
Please, take me with you!
Gimme a break, I'm scared!

210
00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:36.190
Please don't make me!

211
00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:38.570
[NAMI]
No one said anything
about diving head first

212
00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:40.030
into a giant whirlpool!

213
00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.460
[USOPP]
Why's it getting dark?!

214
00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:44.720
[CHOPPER]
Oh, no! We're being sucked in!

215
00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.100
Don't be so unreasonable, Luffy!

216
00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:48.020
Let's go back while
we still have time!

217
00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.860
Don't you understand
this sky island stuff

218
00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:51.190
is just a bunch of make‐believe?

219
00:11:51.190 --> 00:11:53.780
It's not worth
getting us killed!

220
00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:56.510
It's all make believe?
Is that what you think?

221
00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:59.850
Usopp's right! I think
this is a really bad idea!

222
00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:03.890
[LUFFY]
It may be a stupid
dream, but I have to try.

223
00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.790
It could be our
greatest adventure!

224
00:12:06.670 --> 00:12:09.550
[USOPP, NAMI]
– No. It's too late.
– No. It's too late.

225
00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:14.840
Instead of wasting
your time bickering,

226
00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.930
you all might wanna take a look.

227
00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:18.260
What do you mean?

228
00:12:20.930 --> 00:12:22.640
[ZORO]
It's sucking us in.

229
00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:25.520
[STRAW HATS yelling]

230
00:12:25.600 --> 00:12:28.190
[SANJI]
Hurry, Nami!
Let my arms protect you!

231
00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:31.180
[STRAW HATS screaming]

232
00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:34.140
[screaming]

233
00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:39.030
[SANJI]
What happened? It disappeared.

234
00:12:39.070 --> 00:12:40.990
[LUFFY]
What's goin' on?

235
00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.660
[USOPP]
Wait. I‐I don't get it.

236
00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.830
Where'd it go?

237
00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.720
I feel it.

238
00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:54.470
It's starting.

239
00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:58.800
[NAMI]
The whirlpool sunk
under the surface.

240
00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:03.550
[USOPP]
You don't mean...

241
00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.810
[BLACKBEARD]
Hold it right there!

242
00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:10.480
Hey, uh, Zoro?

243
00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.350
Look.

244
00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:17.820
[BLACKBEARD]
Well, well, well.

245
00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:24.260
If it isn't Straw Hat Luffy.

246
00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:27.100
It's him. It's that
Mock Town guy!

247
00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:29.770
What guy?

248
00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:31.100
I've come all this
way to collect

249
00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:33.100
on your hundred‐
million‐Berry bounty!

250
00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:35.020
So don't be shy!

251
00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:39.680
[BLACKBEARD laughing]

252
00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:42.340
[SHOJO]
Were those youngsters
expecting some company?

253
00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:44.970
[MASIRA]
I don't know, brother.

254
00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:51.120
Hm? Why's it getting
dark out here?

255
00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:54.250
Hundred million?
What're you talkin' about?

256
00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.960
Don't play dumb with me, kid.

257
00:13:57.030 --> 00:13:58.280
It says right here.

258
00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:01.910
Monkey D. Luffy wanted
for a hundred million.

259
00:14:01.950 --> 00:14:06.300
And for Pirate Hunter Zoro:
60 million Berries!

260
00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:09.300
It's true. He's got a different
poster for each of you.

261
00:14:09.300 --> 00:14:12.720
Hey, Zoro. Congratulations
on your new bounty! Ha!

262
00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:14.230
[SANJI]
Wait a minute, Usopp!

263
00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:16.690
Come on. Do you see one for me?

264
00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:18.140
[USOPP]
Uh, no.

265
00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:19.380
Look closer.

266
00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.210
Nothin'.

267
00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.230
It looks like your bounties
must've gone way up

268
00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:27.010
after the Alabasta incident.

269
00:14:27.020 --> 00:14:28.680
But a hundred million?

270
00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.270
[LUFFY]
This is great!

271
00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:33.780
Hear that? My bounty
went up big time!

272
00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:34.610
[ZORO chuckles]

273
00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:36.950
Sixty million's not
too bad either.

274
00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:38.690
It's not a good thing!

275
00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:45.290
[SHOJO]
Make sure to keep your
eyes open, Going Merry crew!

276
00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:51.450
It's here. I hope
they're ready for it.

277
00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.120
[SHOJO]
Brace yourselves!

278
00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:58.000
[BLACKBEARD]
Huh?

279
00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.290
[SANJI]
Everyone hold on or get inside!

280
00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.000
[USOPP screaming]

281
00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:05.840
[USOPP]
Oh, no! The ship!
It's being lifted up!

282
00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:09.290
[USOPP crying]

283
00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:21.390
[ALL screaming]

284
00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:47.430
[MASIRA CREWMAN B]
Help! We're gonna capsize!

285
00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:51.850
Hold steady!

286
00:15:52.110 --> 00:15:53.600
Don't let go, men!

287
00:15:57.360 --> 00:16:00.280
[MASIRA, SHOJO]
– Go sky island!
– Go sky island!

288
00:16:00.320 --> 00:16:02.740
[STRAW HATS yelling]

289
00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.350
[USOPP]
What's happening?!

290
00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:06.830
[SANJI]
We're sailing up
a huge pillar of water!

291
00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:08.370
[LUFFY]
This is awesome!

292
00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:10.880
[USOPP]
How are we doing this?!

293
00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:13.550
Wind.

294
00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:17.890
[LUFFY]
All right! I can't
believe it's finally happening.

295
00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:20.930
Let's go to Skypiea!

296
00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:26.010
Hold on. It's not gonna
be that easy. Look!

297
00:16:26.020 --> 00:16:26.930
Oh, what now?!

298
00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:29.970
What's wrong? Did we
forget about something?

299
00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:31.680
[SANJI]
The hull's starting to float!

300
00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.000
[NAMI]
Huh?

301
00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:35.350
[SANJI]
If we don't stop it,
we're gonna fall into the ocean!

302
00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:36.970
[USOPP]
What do ya expect
us to do about it?

303
00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:39.310
We're having a hard enough
time holding on as it is,

304
00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.760
or haven't you noticed?

305
00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:43.270
Oh, no! What is that?!

306
00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:45.340
[ZORO]
The Sea King!

307
00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.860
[CHOPPER]
Is that the one from before?!

308
00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:53.580
See, it's only a matter of time

309
00:16:53.620 --> 00:16:55.950
before the same thing
happens to the Merry!

310
00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:58.310
I know! But what can we do?

311
00:16:58.310 --> 00:16:59.570
We don't have a
whole lot of options

312
00:16:59.610 --> 00:17:01.320
when it comes to mother nature.

313
00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:02.400
We're at her mercy.

314
00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:05.820
[SANJI]
I guess we hold on
and hope for the best!

315
00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:08.240
[screams]

316
00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:10.530
Ships are falling from the sky!

317
00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:12.860
We're gonna end up
driftwood, just like them!

318
00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:15.140
[USOPP]
We're gonna take a nose
dive to the bottom of the ocean

319
00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:18.930
all because Luffy had to
follow some stupid dream!

320
00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:22.810
[NAMI]
Spread the sails! Right now!

321
00:17:23.210 --> 00:17:26.250
Sure it's a pillar of water,
but it's still part of the sea.

322
00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:27.940
It's a rising current!

323
00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:30.380
The wind from below is
a rising air current

324
00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:33.800
produced by geothermal heat,
causing a steam explosion!

325
00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:37.150
It may be packaged differently,
but it's still wind and water!

326
00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:39.250
Trust me. I'm a
navigator, aren't I?

327
00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:43.250
[SANJI]
Thank you, Nami!

328
00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.380
All right, gang!
Nami's leading the way!

329
00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.160
[STRAW HATS]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

330
00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.080
[NAMI]
All right, guys,
catch the starboard wind

331
00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:51.570
and align the ship
with the current!

332
00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:53.240
[STRAW HATS]
– Yes, ma'am!
– Yes, ma'am!

333
00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.450
Hey, we're rising up off
the water! Is that okay?

334
00:17:57.450 --> 00:18:00.970
[LUFFY]
Nami, do something!
We're gonna fall!

335
00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.980
Come on. Do it!

336
00:18:04.860 --> 00:18:08.150
[LUFFY]
We're flying!

337
00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:13.070
Yeah! We're headed to the sky!

338
00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.610
We made it.

339
00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:16.950
[screams]

340
00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.120
I did it!

341
00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:19.780
Yes!

342
00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.210
Nami! Good job!

343
00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:25.670
I think I love you!

344
00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:28.450
[CRICKET]
Go for it, kid!

345
00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:31.160
Always remember
to keep dreaming!

346
00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:38.520
[MASIRA, SHOJO]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

347
00:18:38.560 --> 00:18:40.060
[NAMI]
If the wind keeps this up,

348
00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:42.390
we can sail as high as we want!

349
00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:46.630
Hey, Nami! Are we
almost to Skypiea?

350
00:18:46.630 --> 00:18:49.510
If it exists, it's
past those clouds!

351
00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:52.680
[LUFFY]
Past the clouds!

352
00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:55.320
I can't wait to find out
what's up in the sky!

353
00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:58.560
Let's bust through
'em and find out!
